{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tower_hardwood","model_identifier":"tower_hardwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tower_hardwood\n\nHardwood tower: a 3 x 3 column platform for ranged units, with a parapet and four standing points (`slot_tower_1..4`), a ladder or stair door at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 3 columns (48 x 48 units, 1.35 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -32..32, y 0..200, z -32..32 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material (repainted in Patch 5 for colour contrast).\n- Cubes: 42, all in `finished`; the construction and ruined state sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in Patch 5 (the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 200 x 48 centred at the origin\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 36)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-12, 124, 12)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (12, 124, 12)"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"log_leg0#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24,0,-24],"to":[-18,140,-18],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,6,140],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[6,0,12,140],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[12,0,18,140],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,0,24,140],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[266,183,272,189],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[272,183,278,189],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8e2c87a5-76a4-5c42-9193-8bbaf335199c"},{"name":"log_leg1#5a3a22","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[18,0,-24],"to":[24,1